@startuml
[*] --> IdleState

IdleState --> DetectingUserLocation : Detecting user location

DetectingUserLocation --> AnalyzingUserBehavior : User is at home
DetectingUserLocation --> CheckingTravelInformation : User is traveling

AnalyzingUserBehavior --> SendingNotification : Analyzing user behavior
CheckingTravelInformation --> SendingNotification : Checking travel information

SendingNotification --> [*] : Final state
SendingNotification --> ViewingDashboard : View notifications

ViewingDashboard --> IdleState : Return to idle

@enduml
